sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor U as Utilisateur
  participant F as Frontend React
  participant A as AuthController
  participant S as AuthService
  participant P as Prisma
  participant DB as PostgreSQL

  U->>F: Saisit email et mot de passe
  F->>A: POST /api/v1/auth/login
  A->>S: validateCredentials(dto)
  S->>P: findUnique(email, include role)
  P->>DB: SELECT User + Role
  DB-->>P: utilisateur actif
  P-->>S: User
  S->>S: compare bcrypt passwordHash
  S->>S: generer JWT
  S-->>A: accessToken + user
  A-->>F: 200 OK
  F->>F: stocker accessToken
  F-->>U: redirection /dashboard
